<title>USA: Allied Capital names Bill Walton chairman.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital names Bill Walton chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Capital Advisers Inc said it named Bill Walton as chairman and chief executive officer of the the Allied Capital Companies to replace David Gladstone, who has stepped down from the post.</p>
<p>Gladstone, 54, will remain with the company as vice chairman.</p>
<p>Walton, 47, has been a director of the company since 1986, the company said. He has been president of the company's Allied Capital Corp II unit since 1996, it added.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
</text>
